# AAD imm8: ASCII adjust AX before division (Intel SDM pseudocode, 386).
# AL = (AL + AH * imm8) mod 256 and AH = 0. SF, ZF and PF follow the new AL;
# OF, AF and CF are undefined. Bound to AX by the decoder; the decoder
# replaces the base read with the instruction's immediate byte.
read ax dst 16
trunc al ax 8
const shift 16 8
lshr ah_wide ax shift
trunc ah ah_wide 8
read base src 8
mul product ah base
add r al product
zext result r 16
write dst result
bit sf r 7
zero zf r
parity pf r
flag SF sf
flag ZF zf
flag PF pf
undef_flag OF
undef_flag AF
undef_flag CF
retire
